        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(6) If an employee is no longer eligible for Surplus Placement as per paragraph 4((d))((4)) or 4((d))((5)) above, all Surplus Placement Requests are canceled; they are not automatically converted to LTP Career Placement Requests.",
