        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(8) When a Surplus Employee accepts a job offer made under the LTP, all other requests on file shall be canceled and the employee may not submit any new Career Placement Requests until the applicable Time-in-Title and Grade and Time-in-Location requirement(s) for the position to be filled have been met.",
